@startuml
title SC-ORD-011 — Paid, but the stock is not confirmed in time
actor Administrator as A
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Notification" as N

P ->> O : PaymentCaptured
note over O : CONFIRMING_STOCK
O ->> I : ConfirmReservation
note over I #ECEFF1 : down
... review deadline ...
O -> O : review deadline reached
note over O #FFF8E1 : SUSPENDED\norder UNDER_REVIEW\nalert raised
O ->> N : OrderPutUnderReview
== the inventory is back ==
A -> O : ConfirmOrderUnderReview, with a comment
note over O : allowed: the payment is captured
O ->> I : ConfirmReservation
I ->> O : ReservationConfirmed
note over O #C8E6C9 : COMPLETED\norder CONFIRMED
O ->> N : OrderConfirmed
@enduml
